<title>USA: Mid Am sees $4.5 mln gain in Q4.</title>
<headline>Mid Am sees $4.5 mln gain in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>BOWLING GREEN, Ohio 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mid Am Inc said Thursday it will record a net pre-tax gain of about $4.5 million from selling substantially all of its credit card balances effective December 12, 1996.</p>
<p>Mid Am said the sale was part of a new agreement with a credit card issuer to provide credit card services to its affiliate bank customers.</p>
<p>The gain will be included in results for the fourth quarter, which ends December 31, said chief financial officer Dennis Nemec.</p>
